        "Background": "Ancel looks like an ordinary twelve-year-old boy, but anyone who spends time with him notices something deeper: a composure, insight, and self-supporting life as a pianist that don't fit his age. Playing piano is only his cover. He's a hitman, equipped with every kind of weapon and gadget and very good at the job. Clients never meet him, targets never survive him, and his youthful look is the ideal disguise. Nobody knows his past."
