      "fields": {
        "Background": "Ancel: Attacks\nHandgun: Happiness is a warm gun. Well, Ancel never seems to be happy, but close enough.\nSniper Rifle: What better way to carry out one's work but from afar and well out of harm's way?\nLength of Wire: If left without other means, Ancel knows how to improvise to take down a target, even if his small frame makes the effort exhausting.\n\nAncel: Character Hooks\nAnyone who angers the wrong person might find Ancel sent after them, and the PCs might try to stop him finishing a job. Or he might just be a friendly face at the local café or bar."
      }
